  "title": "Project Meridian and Pentagon's Future Strategic Collaboration",
  "summary": "Elon Musk and Palmer Luckey will lead the 'Project Meridian' to provide recommendations on the technological and operational requirements of the next-generation battlefield, while Tesla and SpaceX CEO Musk will help identify future weapons and tech for potential global conflicts. This collaboration aims to enhance U.S. military capabilities.",
